Hi Sam,

We will go over the gate coverage this month at the orientation today.  I w=
ould be fine with having you opening and closing the gates, but I would sti=
ll like to find someone to cover your days off so that we have the coverage=
 on Wednesdays and Thursdays just in case you needed to leave for your days=
 off and to give you a break on your days off as well.

I haven't officially started the 2026 schedule yet, but I have you noted as=
 interested in February, March & April in my calendar.  As we get further a=
long into February and March, I would be able to officially put you on the =
schedule for 2026 but cannot make any promises yet as we are just getting s=
tarted.

As for the October position, I have filled it as of this morning.  The only=
 month left that I would have open will be December of 2025, also at the we=
lcome center.

[cid:image001.jpg@01DB7625.12574BA0]Logan Bliss | Volunteer Services Lead/R=
anger 1
