Subject: Gate



Ranger Logan,



I just want to offer to open and close the gate for you through February (M=
arch as well if I can keep my site). I just watched someone cut across the =
landscape with a powerful flashlight to come and close it. It's right acros=
s from me - I'm happy to do it. Even on my days off. If I'm not around for =
some reason, I could let the ranger on duty know. Your call.



Gatekeeper Sam



